---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home" description="Heliophysics and Space Weather research group at Universidad de Santiago de Chile. Radiation belts, ULF waves, GIC and machine learning for space weather forecasting.">

<section class="hero-banner">
  <h1>Heliophysics & Space Weather USACH</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="max-width:650px;margin:0 auto">
    We investigate the dynamics of Earth's radiation belts, ULF waves in the magnetosphere, and develop predictive models for space weather using artificial intelligence.
  </p>
</section>

<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">14+</div><div class="stat-label">Active projects</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">29</div><div class="stat-label">Peer-reviewed papers</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">10+</div><div class="stat-label">Students trained</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">4</div><div class="stat-label">Collaborating countries</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-value">700+</div><div class="stat-label">Citations</div></div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <span class="section-title">Research lines</span>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="badge badge-green">Space physics</span>
      <h3>Radiation belts</h3>
      <p>Relativistic electron energization and decay. Enhancement and dropout events in the outer belt. Formation and evolution of ultrarelativistic remnant belts.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="badge badge-green">Space physics</span>
      <h3>ULF waves & turbulence</h3>
      <p>Wave-particle interactions in the magnetosphere. Turbulence and total pressure balance. Solar wind — magnetosphere coupling and effects on satellites.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="badge badge-orange">Data science</span>
      <h3>ML for space weather</h3>
      <p>Prediction of ground magnetic perturbations, geomagnetically induced currents (GIC), and near real-time forecasting models with deep learning.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <span class="section-title">Research platforms</span>
  <div class="card" style="border-color:var(--border-accent)">
    <h3>🛰️ Chilean Space Weather Platform</h3>
    <p>Chile's first national pilot platform for real-time space weather monitoring and early warnings. FONDEF IDEA I+D project funded by ANID.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:1rem;display:flex;gap:0.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <span class="badge">Real-time monitoring</span>
      <span class="badge">DL predictive models</span>
      <span class="badge">HPC platform</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>⚡ HPC Platform USACH</h3>
    <p>High-performance computing platform for data science, simulations, and numerical modeling. FONDEQUIP EQM230160 project.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="contacto">
  <span class="section-title">Contact</span>
  <div class="card">
    <p><strong>Dr. Victor A. Pinto</strong> — Principal Investigator</p>
    <p>Department of Physics, Universidad de Santiago de Chile (USACH)</p>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:victor.pinto@usach.cl">victor.pinto@usach.cl</a></p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.5rem">
      <a href="https://instagram.com/helio.usach" target="_blank">@helio.usach (IG)</a> ·
      <a href="https://twitter.com/vpintoa" target="_blank">@vpintoa (X)</a> ·
      <a href="https://github.com/vpinto-space" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>